# Gemini 2.5 Pro

{% callout type="caution" %}
  Gemini 2.5 Pro (`gemini-2.5-pro`) is
  [deprecated](/docs/deprecations#gemini-2.5-pro-models) and is no longer
  available to select in Google AI Studio (API access is limited to existing users
  until December 1, 2026). Effective December 1, 2026, all API requests to
  `gemini-2.5-pro` will automatically route to
  [Gemini 3.8 Flash (`gemini-3.8-flash`)](/docs/models/gemini-3.8-flash) and be
  billed at [Gemini 3.8 Flash rates](/docs/pricing#gemini-3.8-flash). Before
  December 1, 2026, update your model string to `gemini-3.8-flash` and review the
  [Gemini 3.8 Flash migration guide](/docs/whats-new-gemini-3.8#migrate-to-gemini-3-8-flash).
  Breaking API changes include function calling and `thought_signature`
  validation, `thinking_level` replacing `thinking_budget`, and removed sampling
  parameters and prefilled model turns.

{% /callout %}

Our state-of-the-art thinking model, capable of reasoning over complex problems
in code, math, and STEM, as well as analyzing large datasets, codebases, and
documents using long context.

